GIVEN `the decision is on a public takeover offer` IS A BOOLEAN                                       -- öffentliche Kaufangebote (Art. 125-141 FinfraG, outside the sources)
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(u) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a public takeover offer` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on a public takeover offer`
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... u. Entscheide auf dem Gebiet der öffentlichen Kaufangebote (Art. 125‒141 des Finanzmarktinfrastrukturgesetzes vom 19. Juni 2015)"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar reaches only decisions on public takeover offers

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:139 | v.[^47] Entscheide des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts über Meinungsverschiedenheiten zwischen Behörden in der innerstaatlichen Amts- und Rechtshilfe;
@ref Art. 83(v) BGG (src:96) (src:139)
GIVEN `the decision is on a disagreement between authorities in domestic administrative and legal assistance` IS A BOOLEAN    -- Meinungsverschiedenheiten zwischen Behörden in der innerstaatlichen Amts- und Rechtshilfe
      `the Federal Administrative Court decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(v) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court on a disagreement between authorities` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on a disagreement between authorities in domestic administrative and legal assistance` AND `the Federal Administrative Court decided`
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... v. Entscheide des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts über Meinungsverschiedenheiten zwischen Behörden in der innerstaatlichen Amts- und Rechtshilfe"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar reaches only decisions "des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts über Meinungsverschiedenheiten zwischen Behörden"

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:140 | w.[^48] Entscheide auf dem Gebiet des Elektrizitätsrechts betreffend die Plangenehmigung von Starkstromanlagen und Schwachstromanlagen und die Entscheide auf diesem Gebiet betreffend Enteignung der für den Bau oder Betrieb solcher Anlagen notwendigen Rechte, wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt;
@ref Art. 83(w) BGG (src:96) (src:140)
GIVEN `the decision is on the plan approval of power installations, or on expropriation of the rights needed for them` IS A BOOLEAN     -- Plangenehmigung von Starkstrom- und Schwachstromanlagen; Enteignung
      `a legal question of fundamental importance arises` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(w) the appeal is admissible against the electricity law decision where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on the plan approval of power installations, or on expropriation of the rights needed for them` AND (NOT `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`)
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... w. Entscheide auf dem Gebiet des Elektrizitätsrechts betreffend die Plangenehmigung von Starkstromanlagen und Schwachstromanlagen und die Entscheide auf diesem Gebiet betreffend Enteignung der für den Bau oder Betrieb solcher Anlagen notwendigen Rechte, wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar applies "wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt"

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:141 | x.[^49] Entscheide betreffend die Gewährung von Solidaritätsbeiträgen nach dem Bundesgesetz vom 30. September 2016[^50] über die Aufarbeitung der fürsorgerischen Zwangsmassnahmen und Fremdplatzierungen vor 1981, ausser wenn sich eine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt oder aus anderen Gründen ein besonders bedeutender Fall vorliegt;
@ref Art. 83(x) BGG (src:96) (src:141)
GIVEN `the decision is on solidarity contributions for coercive welfare measures and placements before 1981` IS A BOOLEAN     -- Solidaritätsbeiträge (SR 211.223.13, outside the sources)
      `a legal question of fundamental importance arises` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the case is particularly important for other reasons` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(x) the appeal is admissible against the decision on solidarity contributions` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on solidarity contributions for coercive welfare measures and placements before 1981` AND (NOT `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`) AND (NOT `the case is particularly important for other reasons`)
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... x. Entscheide betreffend die Gewährung von Solidaritätsbeiträgen ..., ausser wenn sich eine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt oder aus anderen Gründen ein besonders bedeutender Fall vorliegt"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "ausser wenn sich eine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt oder aus anderen Gründen ein besonders bedeutender Fall vorliegt"

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:142 | y.[^51] Entscheide des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts in Verständigungsverfahren zur Vermeidung einer den anwendbaren internationalen Abkommen im Steuerbereich nicht entsprechenden Besteuerung;
@ref Art. 83(y) BGG (src:96) (src:142)
GIVEN `the decision is on a mutual agreement procedure on taxation` IS A BOOLEAN                       -- Verständigungsverfahren
      `the Federal Administrative Court decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(y) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court in a mutual agreement procedure` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on a mutual agreement procedure on taxation` AND `the Federal Administrative Court decided`
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... y. Entscheide des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts in Verständigungsverfahren zur Vermeidung einer den anwendbaren internationalen Abkommen im Steuerbereich nicht entsprechenden Besteuerung"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar reaches only decisions "des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts in Verständigungsverfahren"

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:143 | z.[^52] Entscheide betreffend die in Artikel 71c Absatz 1 Buchstabe b des Energiegesetzes vom 30. September 2016[^53] genannten Baubewilligungen und notwendigerweise damit zusammenhängenden in der Kompetenz der Kantone liegenden Bewilligungen für Windenergieanlagen von nationalem Interesse, wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt;
@ref Art. 83(z) BGG (src:96) (src:143)
GIVEN `the decision is on a building permit for a wind energy installation of national interest` IS A BOOLEAN   -- Art. 71c Abs. 1 Bst. b des Energiegesetzes (SR 730.0): outside the sources
      `a legal question of fundamental importance arises` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(z) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a building permit for a wind energy installation where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on a building permit for a wind energy installation of national interest` AND (NOT `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`)
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... z. Entscheide betreffend die in Artikel 71c Absatz 1 Buchstabe b des Energiegesetzes ... genannten Baubewilligungen ... für Windenergieanlagen von nationalem Interesse, wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar applies "wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt"

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:144 | zbis.[^54] Entscheide über die Gewährung von Wasserrechtskonzessionen für Anlagen nach Artikel 9a Absatz 3 in Verbindung mit Anhang 2 des Stromversorgungsgesetzes vom 23. März 2007[^55], wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt;
@ref Art. 83(zbis) BGG (src:96) (src:144)
GIVEN `the decision is on a water-right concession for a plant under Art 9a(3) of the Electricity Supply Act` IS A BOOLEAN    -- Stromversorgungsgesetz (SR 734.7): outside the sources
      `a legal question of fundamental importance arises` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(zbis) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a water-right concession where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on a water-right concession for a plant under Art 9a(3) of the Electricity Supply Act` AND (NOT `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`)
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... zbis. Entscheide über die Gewährung von Wasserrechtskonzessionen für Anlagen nach Artikel 9a Absatz 3 in Verbindung mit Anhang 2 des Stromversorgungsgesetzes ..., wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar applies "wenn sich keine Rechtsfrage von grundsätzlicher Bedeutung stellt"

-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
-- src:145 | zter.[^56] Entscheide über Beschwerden von Organisationen nach den Artikeln 55 des Umweltschutzgesetzes vom 7. Oktober 1983[^57] und 12 des Bundesgesetzes vom 1. Juli 1966[^58] über den Natur- und Heimatschutz betreffend Wasserkraftwerke nach Artikel 9a Absatz 3 und Anhang 2 in der Fassung vom 29. September 2023[^59] des Stromversorgungsgesetzes.
@ref Art. 83(zter) BGG (src:96) (src:145)
GIVEN `the decision is on a complaint by an organisation about a hydropower plant under Art 9a(3) of the Electricity Supply Act` IS A BOOLEAN    -- Beschwerden von Organisationen nach Art. 55 USG und Art. 12 NHG: outside the sources
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83(zter) the appeal is admissible against the decision on an organisation's complaint about a hydropower plant` MEANS
    IF `the decision is on a complaint by an organisation about a hydropower plant under Art 9a(3) of the Electricity Supply Act`
    THEN JUST FALSE         -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen: ... zter. Entscheide über Beschwerden von Organisationen nach den Artikeln 55 des Umweltschutzgesetzes ... und 12 des Bundesgesetzes ... über den Natur- und Heimatschutz betreffend Wasserkraftwerke nach Artikel 9a Absatz 3 und Anhang 2 in der Fassung vom 29. September 2023 des Stromversorgungsgesetzes"
    ELSE NOTHING            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar reaches only decisions on those organisations' complaints about hydropower plants

-- Art 83 as a whole: the chapeau "Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:" over the list a to zter.
-- The kind of decision picks the limb; the facts record carries the conditions inside the limbs.
-- Each limb answers for itself (fork F10: a decision that falls in two limbs is not combined here).
-- src:95 | Art. 83 Ausnahmen
-- src:96 | Die Beschwerde ist unzulässig gegen:
@ref Art. 83 BGG (the chapeau and the list) (src:95-96)
GIVEN kind IS A `Art 83 kind of decision`
      facts IS A `Art 83 facts`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 83 the appeal is admissible against the decision` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `(a) security, neutrality, diplomatic protection or other foreign affairs` THEN
        `Art 83(a) the appeal is admissible against the decision on security and foreign affairs` TRUE (facts's `international law gives a claim to judicial review`)
    WHEN `(b) ordinary naturalisation` THEN
        `Art 83(b) the appeal is admissible against the decision on ordinary naturalisation` TRUE
    WHEN `(c)(1) foreigners law: entry` THEN
        `Art 83(c)(1) the appeal is admissible against the foreigners law decision on entry` TRUE TRUE
    WHEN `(c)(2) foreigners law: a permit` THEN
        `Art 83(c)(2) the appeal is admissible against the foreigners law decision on a permit` TRUE TRUE (facts's `federal law or international law gives a claim to the permit`)
    WHEN `(c)(3) foreigners law: provisional admission` THEN
        `Art 83(c)(3) the appeal is admissible against the foreigners law decision on provisional admission` TRUE TRUE
    WHEN `(c)(4) foreigners law: expulsion under Art 121(2) of the Federal Constitution, or removal` THEN
        `Art 83(c)(4) the appeal is admissible against the foreigners law decision on expulsion or removal` TRUE TRUE
    WHEN `(c)(5) foreigners law: deviation from the admission requirements` THEN
        `Art 83(c)(5) the appeal is admissible against the foreigners law decision on a deviation from the admission requirements` TRUE TRUE
    WHEN `(c)(6) foreigners law: cross-border commuters and travel papers for stateless foreigners` THEN
        `Art 83(c)(6) the appeal is admissible against the foreigners law decision on commuters and travel papers` TRUE TRUE
    WHEN `(d)(1) asylum: decision of the Federal Administrative Court` THEN
        `Art 83(d)(1) the appeal is admissible against the asylum decision of the Federal Administrative Court` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`) (facts's `an extradition request is pending from the state of refuge`)
    WHEN `(d)(2) asylum: decision of a cantonal lower instance on a permit` THEN
        `Art 83(d)(2) the appeal is admissible against the asylum decision of a cantonal lower instance` TRUE (facts's `a cantonal lower instance decided`) (facts's `federal law or international law gives a claim to the permit`)
    WHEN `(e) refusal to authorise prosecution of members of authorities or federal staff` THEN
        `Art 83(e) the appeal is admissible against the decision refusing to authorise prosecution` TRUE
    WHEN `(f) public procurement` THEN
        `Art 83(f) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision` TRUE (facts's `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`) (facts's `the procuring body is one that item (f)(1) reserves`) (facts's `the estimated value of the contract to be awarded`) (facts's `the threshold under the Public Procurement Act`)
    WHEN `(fbis) Federal Administrative Court decision on an order under Art 32i of the Passenger Transport Act` THEN
        `Art 83(fbis) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court on an order under Art 32i of the Passenger Transport Act` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`)
    WHEN `(g) public-law employment` THEN
        `Art 83(g) the appeal is admissible against the decision on public-law employment` TRUE (facts's `the matter is not pecuniary`) (facts's `the matter concerns equality of the sexes`)
    WHEN `(h) international administrative assistance` THEN
        `Art 83(h) the appeal is admissible against the decision on international administrative assistance` TRUE (facts's `the assistance is in tax matters`)
    WHEN `(i) military, civilian and civil protection service` THEN
        `Art 83(i) the appeal is admissible against the decision on military, civilian or civil protection service` TRUE
    WHEN `(j) economic national supply in severe shortages` THEN
        `Art 83(j) the appeal is admissible against the decision on economic national supply` TRUE (facts's `the decision was taken in a severe shortage`)
    WHEN `(k) subsidies to which there is no claim` THEN
        `Art 83(k) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a subsidy to which there is no claim` TRUE (facts's `a claim to the subsidy exists`)
    WHEN `(l) customs assessment by tariff classification or weight` THEN
        `Art 83(l) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a customs assessment` TRUE (facts's `the customs assessment rests on tariff classification or on the weight of the goods`)
    WHEN `(m) deferral or remission of levies` THEN
        `Art 83(m) the appeal is admissible against the decision on deferral or remission of levies` TRUE (facts's `the remission concerns the direct federal tax or a cantonal or communal income or profit tax`) (facts's `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`) (facts's `the case is particularly important for other reasons`)
    WHEN `(n)(1) nuclear energy: need for a release or for a change of a permit or order` THEN
        `Art 83(n)(1) the appeal is admissible against the nuclear energy decision on a release or a change of a permit or order` TRUE
    WHEN `(n)(2) nuclear energy: approval of a provisions plan for decommissioning costs` THEN
        `Art 83(n)(2) the appeal is admissible against the nuclear energy decision approving a provisions plan` TRUE
    WHEN `(n)(3) nuclear energy: releases` THEN
        `Art 83(n)(3) the appeal is admissible against the nuclear energy decision on releases` TRUE
    WHEN `(o) type approval of road vehicles` THEN
        `Art 83(o) the appeal is admissible against the decision on the type approval of road vehicles` TRUE
    WHEN `(p)(1) telecommunications, radio, television and post: concessions` THEN
        `Art 83(p)(1) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court on a concession that was publicly tendered` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`) (facts's `the concession was the subject of a public tender`)
    WHEN `(p)(2) telecommunications, radio, television and post: disputes under Art 11a of the Telecommunications Act` THEN
        `Art 83(p)(2) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court on a dispute under Art 11a of the Telecommunications Act` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`)
    WHEN `(p)(3) telecommunications, radio, television and post: disputes under Art 8 of the Postal Act` THEN
        `Art 83(p)(3) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court on a dispute under Art 8 of the Postal Act` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`)
    WHEN `(q)(1) transplantation medicine: entry on the waiting list` THEN
        `Art 83(q)(1) the appeal is admissible against the transplantation decision on entry on the waiting list` TRUE
    WHEN `(q)(2) transplantation medicine: allocation of organs` THEN
        `Art 83(q)(2) the appeal is admissible against the transplantation decision on the allocation of organs` TRUE
    WHEN `(r) health insurance: Federal Administrative Court decision under Art 34 of the Administrative Court Act` THEN
        `Art 83(r) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court in health insurance under Art 34 of the Administrative Court Act` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`) TRUE
    WHEN `(s)(2) agriculture: delimitation of the zones of the production cadastre` THEN
        `Art 83(s)(2) the appeal is admissible against the agricultural decision on the delimitation of zones` TRUE
    WHEN `(t) results of examinations and other ability assessments` THEN
        `Art 83(t) the appeal is admissible against the decision on the result of an examination or other ability assessment` TRUE
    WHEN `(u) public takeover offers` THEN
        `Art 83(u) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a public takeover offer` TRUE
    WHEN `(v) Federal Administrative Court decision on disagreements between authorities in domestic administrative and legal assistance` THEN
        `Art 83(v) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court on a disagreement between authorities` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`)
    WHEN `(w) electricity law: plan approval of power installations, and expropriation for them` THEN
        `Art 83(w) the appeal is admissible against the electricity law decision where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` TRUE (facts's `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`)
    WHEN `(x) solidarity contributions for coercive welfare measures and placements before 1981` THEN
        `Art 83(x) the appeal is admissible against the decision on solidarity contributions` TRUE (facts's `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`) (facts's `the case is particularly important for other reasons`)
    WHEN `(y) Federal Administrative Court decision in a mutual agreement procedure on taxation` THEN
        `Art 83(y) the appeal is admissible against the decision of the Federal Administrative Court in a mutual agreement procedure` TRUE (facts's `the Federal Administrative Court decided`)
    WHEN `(z) building permits for wind energy installations of national interest` THEN
        `Art 83(z) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a building permit for a wind energy installation where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` TRUE (facts's `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`)
    WHEN `(zbis) water-right concessions for plants under Art 9a(3) of the Electricity Supply Act` THEN
        `Art 83(zbis) the appeal is admissible against the decision on a water-right concession where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` TRUE (facts's `a legal question of fundamental importance arises`)
    WHEN `(zter) complaints by organisations about hydropower plants` THEN
        `Art 83(zter) the appeal is admissible against the decision on an organisation's complaint about a hydropower plant` TRUE
    WHEN `none of these kinds` THEN
        NOTHING             -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): Art 83 lists bars and does not say that a decision outside the list is admissible
